      "writtenOn": "2024-11-02T00:13:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, clarify description (use Gemini!). For instance:\n\n```\n * Get the metadata of a specified Broadcast Source added to this Broadcast Sink.\n *\n * \u003cp\u003eThis method retrieves the locally managed {@link BluetoothLeBroadcastMetadata} for the specified broadcast source. \n * This metadata is stored in the Broadcast Sink\u0027s {@link BluetoothLeBroadcastReceiveState} \n * and is managed using {@link #addSource(BluetoothDevice, BluetoothLeBroadcastMetadata, boolean)} \n * and {@link #modifySource(BluetoothDevice, int, BluetoothLeBroadcastMetadata)}.\n *\n * \u003cp\u003eIf no matching metadata is found for the given `sourceId`, this method returns null.\n *\n * @param sink The Broadcast Sink device.\n * @param sourceId The Broadcast Source ID. Valid range is [0, 0xFF] as defined in the \n *                 Broadcast Audio Scan Service specification 1.0 (3.2. Broadcast Receive State).\n * @return The {@link BluetoothLeBroadcastMetadata} for the source, or null if not found.\n * @throws IllegalArgumentException If `sourceId` is outside the valid range [0, 0xFF].\n```",
